    "body": "I cannot use `FrozenArray` then either since it's constructor takes an IDL value. I'm not sure I want to inline all of that. That would be rather bad and I'd likely make mistakes or it would result in mismatches down the line.\r\n\r\nThere is some mismatch here though with implementations I think where JS values are backed by IDL values and you can manipulate either. That's not conversion, but just grabbing the corresponding value, but IDL doesn't formalize that.",
